---
title: "record_user_rebates (protocol::referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_type: self, who, amount
    q_get_type --> q_check_user: coin_type = type_name::with_defining_ids()
    q_check_user --> q_new_user: !self.user_rebates_records.contains(who)
    q_check_user --> q_existing_user: self.user_rebates_records.contains(who)
    q_new_user --> q_insert_new: user_rebates = vec_map::empty()
    q_insert_new --> [*]: user_rebates.insert(coin_type, amount), self.user_rebates_records.add(who, user_rebates)
    q_existing_user --> q_check_coin: user_rebates = self.user_rebates_records.borrow_mut(who)
    q_check_coin --> q_new_coin: !user_rebates.contains(coin_type)
    q_check_coin --> q_accumulate: user_rebates.contains(coin_type)
    q_new_coin --> [*]: user_rebates.insert(coin_type, amount)
    q_accumulate --> [*]: *current = *current + amount

    note right of q_check_user
        INV-001: Creates new VecMap for first-time users
        INV-002: Inserts new coin type entry for users without that coin type
        INV-003: Accumulates amount for existing user + coin type combinations
        INV-004: Amount is always additive (monotonically increasing until claimed)
    end note
